sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Vendor as Vendor
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Vendor: terminate(reason)
    Note over Vendor: Policies: vendorRead, vendorWrite, vendorExecute
    Note over Vendor: Guards (4)
    Vendor->>Vendor: guard[0]: self.onboardedAt != null
    Vendor->>Vendor: guard[1]: self.status == #quot;active#quot; or self.status == #quot;suspended#quot;
    Vendor->>Vendor: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Vendor->>Vendor: guard[3]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;inventoryManageAccess#quot;)
    Vendor->>Vendor: mutate.status
    Vendor->>Vendor: mutate.terminatedAt
    Vendor->>Vendor: mutate.terminationReason
    Vendor->>Vendor: mutate.deletedAt
    Vendor->>EventBus: emit VendorTerminated on vendor.terminated
    Vendor-->>-Client: void